# Water Level Indicator

## Description

The Water Level Indicator is a digital system designed using Verilog HDL to monitor the water level in a tank.

It detects four water levels:

- Low
- Medium
- High
- Full

## Features

- Simple Verilog HDL design
- Detects different water levels
- Provides digital output indications
- Includes a testbench
- Includes simulation waveform

## Technologies Used

- Verilog HDL
- Digital Logic Design
- Simulation and Verification

